From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marlo <Plays.xenon@yahoo.de>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:14:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Editor overlay: retained world-space lines and icons
 (ed_overlay_*), drawn by the world view; ed_sim_clear_deposits

EdOverlay: polylines as terrain-hugging ribbons with world width and a minimum pixel width (distance-scaled thickness), dark halo, constant-size textured icons anchored to world points. Hooked into CUIWorldView::Render after the projectile arcs (main view only).
EdSimResources + CSimResources::EditorClearDeposits: lets the editor recreate the sim's resource deposits from the map's markers before a build check.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

